<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="93ee062a-acad-54ca-b0c6-56d6d621d09c" name="I Legion Dark Angels" revision="7" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="86405571-5289-597b-b308-a9a2d68c00b9" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false">
 <selectionEntries>
 <selectionEntry id="ef76ae37-3ada-58f6-a5d9-c5406f815e56" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="747eb2f7-9b18-5879-aed8-b1142b7573ab" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="6a7f7fac-1fcd-572b-ab48-3e8bfd92da21" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">9</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">6</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">8″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">7</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="95fcdc19-a63e-5326-8528-56ca7644edc6" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="443ce848-71d3-404f-a6d0-950fde1804b0" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Ordnance: 3 · Dorsal: 3 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ab1e1147-a363-4986-9eeb-02126c0c251d" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9d83d127-efb5-4bbc-b785-f2b9b358c62c" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 7 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow Ordnance 3 · Dorsal 3 · Defence 6 · Hangars 1. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="791f2d0b-e469-552d-bd61-f6d34b36f6b5" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="210af9dd-8089-5ec6-b8c7-cd7ffaa9d007" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="95fe20e3-0f0c-5707-99a6-6be64cd42ed9" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="8f51a5f1-79cb-5d5d-a037-ebc6b34e86ed" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="7a9b2d24-408c-5b4f-b83c-6d7c73233f73" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="10dffffb-3254-5a73-927b-03f90bab3701" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="dbee46e7-fbfd-5519-940e-0a35b5cc5d65" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="1c34a490-b024-5c25-a4e8-80462bc7d148" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="356b4f4b-c161-5ae4-9b0c-86f317dda527" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="4a13515d-bf32-57ea-84c1-089013740a4a" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="34e17e46-9873-53bb-a55f-fb087377e0e4" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="c713be06-3b66-5505-9b81-ed5f9463293e" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="37435d2f-53f4-5d13-94bc-4a16d155ff92" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="false" />
 <categoryLink id="d6b1cd67-c211-5230-bea6-d0be08f838eb" name="Open Play Fleet" hidden="false" targetId="f4a1bdc9-d680-5abd-a007-4b0b71797ecd" primary="true" /></categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup id="71f791dc-e3fa-48a3-b4ea-28111290e531" name="Fleet Role" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="d718720b-d164-48b0-8170-cf9c43d715e0" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="b2b1da95-3b6a-4548-8d45-45f7df9f7de9" name="Designate as Flagship" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><profiles><profile id="13b5efff-f256-4ab7-a50f-1ee83bd11c86" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander here. The Commander is embarked on this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="fb65434d-119a-55c1-8ebc-4a57698f726d" name="Flagship" hidden="false"><description>This ship is the fleet's Flagship. Exactly one Flagship is required in a standard fleet.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="b4ccc449-b504-4d0c-903e-10efacb724c5" name="Flagship" hidden="false" targetId="9a05d1db-3fb3-5329-a5a0-257d3cb53d11" primary="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="c5686f56-1a2b-4236-a871-5ce779a01446" name="Fleet Commander" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="1ecd9a61-a7e4-4576-aa90-8d0023e9454e" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="6747ba66-395e-4a8c-bbd9-4b2bbd0bac54" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5041a4d8-c09d-4d6a-b295-0d