 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="fa9956c7-1cfd-5f7e-b118-54547e0608fc" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="0e9dbe0e-d611-5196-b185-4701b98f0717" name="Battleship" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">14</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">8</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">8″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">8</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="21c4f8b0-cd3d-5fdd-895c-578f9305a826" name="Bulwark of the Line" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Enemy Damage Table rolls against this ship suffer −1.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="706587e0-bf5d-55ed-b352-d5cce33b019d" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="bd277e5a-b54c-5866-bff8-4ac240a68547" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="97f2d02b-5a79-4646-98e0-658b273a99c9" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Port Heavy: 2 · Starboard: 3 · Starboard Heavy: 2 · Prow Ordnance: 4 · Prow Super-Heavy: 1 · Dorsal: 4 · Defence: 8 · Hangar: 2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="844b3614-6745-4af2-92be-9939862de636" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="94458459-d9a9-4490-a460-c26a076a81cb" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 8 · Port 3 · Port Heavy 2 · Starboard 3 · Starboard Heavy 2 · Prow Ordnance 4 · Prow Super-Heavy 1 · Dorsal 4 · Defence 8 · Hangars 2. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="cad2ca66-b4d0-5385-a5cc-39d44b66c154" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="381bac1a-35b5-52f6-8aec-cca628ab9ce5" name="Twin-Linked" hidden="false"><description>Re-roll failed To Hit rolls.</description></rule><rule id="944115f7-9a38-5d1d-9af0-d0dd32c56d13" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="bd21a8ab-e22a-5516-8bad-81c7c3ffb28c" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="3375bd9d-8d92-5757-822d-dec6b144e654" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="3dd9b5bb-e567-5f45-8ac1-13935b206e33" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="480b19f0-67b5-5b0a-815b-2b9080226284" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="b104ef65-f2c1-5aa8-b2c9-fee4c051d96e" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="779a2bcb-a8fc-5157-915b-1435c1a05041" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="03f09cfd-a2d7-54d6-9ecb-6ce09df65666" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="fb56035e-d76d-57c7-918c-1bfeb269f7d6" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="3b185b0f-4ce2-5c26-abd0-a6f90aad655d" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="4f673718-d089-533a-a9ea-2785c446b997" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="78797cf8-6737-54b4-80ff-fd3f8e358728" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="false" />
 <categoryLink id="35f77efe-ac90-552d-b0ef-fe26e3ef950c" name="Open Play Fleet" hidden="false" targetId="f4a1bdc9-d680-5abd-a007-4b0b71797ecd" primary="true" /></categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup id="c9ade5a8-7708-4eae-8eec-abbce8646a9f" name="Fleet Role" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="a0435dc4-3b48-4b6e-95e7-324c735dd66f" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="1bb3cff7-c3d0-4fb1-8fff-57c46bb47033" name="Designate as Flagship" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><profiles><profile id="a3eb7ae5-05d7-4264-8685-0ac566bc9d0b" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander here. The Commander is embarked on this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="f6fcc3c0-d428-5508-ae3e-61030f106f0d" name="Flagship" hidden="false"><description>This ship is the fleet's Flagship. Exactly one Flagship is required in a standard fleet.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="4413b4a2-9b2c-4f35-97eb-38348c0692af" name="Flagship" hidden="false" targetId="9a05d1db-3fb3-5329-a5a0-257d3cb53d11" primary="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="d7153db0-445c-4e22-953a-c9f628b9cc47" name="Fleet Commander" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="23bc2663-18f0-4081-80cf-c63a781998a4" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="4df3e8b5-ad22-4794-8ae3-a952b6ef0e75" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="7120c99e-10b8-43e0-95f9-0f957b9088c7" name="Fleet Captain" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
