 <categoryLink id="0cccd9a5-5f9b-578c-8d66-25d9be17c457" name="Open Play Fleet" hidden="false" targetId="f4a1bdc9-d680-5abd-a007-4b0b71797ecd" primary="false" /><categoryLink id="5d15d960-0965-5a18-8f97-5e99a5e9a339" name="Rules" hidden="false" targetId="52616092-abd8-519e-a6fb-94b622114fa5" primary="true" /></categoryLinks>
 </selectionEntry>
 <selectionEntry id="1b0eee70-f5dd-408d-a3fe-1f8959e45292" name="Battle Carrier" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="a5ff396a-1d5f-589e-acbf-b21ff6186823" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="2b3a8dbc-fb0e-47c3-b282-3290cbb6d4a4" name="Battle Carrier" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">14</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">8</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">6″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">8</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="dded3e0f-6e30-4b7e-9f1a-24dcec4a22c8" name="Bulwark of the Line" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Enemy Damage Table rolls against this ship suffer −1.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="f72149d2-dbf6-4e40-bc73-3718b0ee5a94" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="fab0d22d-d5ed-4d5d-9c27-b0cf77f57b72" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="6a99354b-6388-4f30-b649-0a9cd9e37f44" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port Heavy: 1 · Starboard Heavy: 1 · Prow Ordnance: 6 · Dorsal: 4 · Defence: 10 · Hangar: 6</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="11672f7e-1546-4371-873f-2c16a49f6fb4" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d22e2f1f-eb26-49ef-9ad4-2d3a146baca5" name="Carrier Flagship Priority" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">A Battle Carrier must be the fleet's Flagship unless a Gloriana is present. New Recruit enforces this through the Fleet Role selection.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="71475d5d-bd43-4075-8d13-fdafa4a88dde" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 8 · Port Heavy 1 · Starboard Heavy 1 · Prow Ordnance 6 · Dorsal 4 · Defence 10 · Hangars 6. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="ea61cc81-19c0-5e93-b12b-08a07123bcca" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="361e45ce-ff20-5b86-ac32-945e19d8e6aa" name="Twin-Linked" hidden="false"><description>Re-roll failed To Hit rolls.</description></rule><rule id="8859bf1e-2480-58d1-9487-68645493a2b6" name="Air Group" hidden="false"><description>Carries six aircraft squadrons free of charge, chosen when the fleet is built. Further squadrons may be bought, but she has nowhere to put them.</description></rule><rule id="386e416d-e9a9-5d37-9005-7299c3b9433b" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="e390f940-6878-5ebf-afe8-524b3850ee9c" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="4d923dfa-d80e-5004-9636-92858452f8fa" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="f66b240f-1278-5deb-84f8-264919bffe83" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="0e43a107-8a35-51fd-8fd4-477515da33c2" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="eaf6cc90-4d18-5ffb-bebb-3987e5c854da" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="e2fc0e99-34f8-5859-ac2d-35bc38d7a3fc" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="7fe445ea-8823-50f8-8679-9a507f600421" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="981e589c-9aa8-5893-860a-38c9a98e63b9" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="9d455978-f437-5a9d-a878-4a5364d36f64" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="fa67c174-8117-515c-afff-734e29ec3415" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="0d5f6865-6df8-429e-ab15-332abd2e189d" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="false" />
 <categoryLink id="b5a136f4-0d65-5a84-98d3-a9f1135746eb" name="Open Play Fleet" hidden="false" targetId="f4a1bdc9-d680-5abd-a007-4b0b71797ecd" primary="true" /></categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
